{"id":"26f419e80554b0b9","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-pa-dnc.md","title":"PA 路径性质与二值 DNC 的完整等价","display":"thm-pa-dnc — PA 路径性质与二值 DNC 的完整等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-pa-dnc","aliases":["20-thm-pa-dnc"],"display":"thm-pa-dnc — PA 路径性质与二值 DNC 的完整等价","chapter":"10","section":"10.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 10.3.3(iii)–(v)","source_printed_pages":[185,186],"source_pdf_pages":[217,218],"depends_on":["[[20-df-pa-degree]]","[[20-df-dnc]]","[[20-thm-dnc2-special-class]]","[[20-thm-dnc2-binary-extension]]","[[20-thm-binary-extension-path]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-pa-dnc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-pa-dnc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pa-dnc — PA 路径性质与二值 DNC 的完整等价"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 10.3.3(iii)–(v)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>185</span><span>186</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>217</span><span>218</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f2db5acb5344c257\" href=\"?note=f2db5acb5344c257\" title=\"20-df-pa-degree\">20-df-pa-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d92408f78f418e97\" href=\"?note=d92408f78f418e97\" title=\"20-df-dnc\">20-df-dnc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b06b2873482f11f7\" href=\"?note=b06b2873482f11f7\" title=\"20-thm-dnc2-special-class\">20-thm-dnc2-special-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7923f429b681274\" href=\"?note=e7923f429b681274\" title=\"20-thm-dnc2-binary-extension\">20-thm-dnc2-binary-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e1cda67d4ddf93f2\" href=\"?note=e1cda67d4ddf93f2\" title=\"20-thm-binary-extension-path\">20-thm-binary-extension-path</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_1^A\">\\(\\mathcal C_1^A\\)</span> 使用固定相对编号；见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 全定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f2db5acb5344c257\" href=\"?note=f2db5acb5344c257\" title=\"20-df-pa-degree\">20-df-pa-degree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d92408f78f418e97\" href=\"?note=d92408f78f418e97\" title=\"20-df-dnc\">20-df-dnc</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b06b2873482f11f7\" href=\"?note=b06b2873482f11f7\" title=\"20-thm-dnc2-special-class\">20-thm-dnc2-special-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"e7923f429b681274\" href=\"?note=e7923f429b681274\" title=\"20-thm-dnc2-binary-extension\">20-thm-dnc2-binary-extension</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e1cda67d4ddf93f2\" href=\"?note=e1cda67d4ddf93f2\" title=\"20-thm-binary-extension-path\">20-thm-binary-extension-path</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pa-dnc}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PAdegree}(\\deg_T(A))\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^A\\ [\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega\\land\\operatorname{DNC}_2(f)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pa-dnc}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PAdegree}(\\deg_T(A))\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^A\\ [\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega\\land\\operatorname{DNC}_2(f)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向把 PA 的路径性质应用于二值 DNC 非空有效闭类，取得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算成员。反向由 DNC–二值延伸等价，再用选枝程序在任意非空有效闭类的可计算树上得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算路径，正好满足 PAdegree 的定义。这里先证明路径定义的等价；与一阶 PA 完成的等度等价在另一个原子中处理。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 10.3.3(iii)–(v)；印刷页 185, 186；PDF 第 217, 218 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-pa-degree","status":"resolved","id":"f2db5acb5344c257","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pa-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-dnc","status":"resolved","id":"d92408f78f418e97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-dnc]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-dnc2-special-class","status":"resolved","id":"b06b2873482f11f7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-dnc2-special-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-dnc2-binary-extension","status":"resolved","id":"e7923f429b681274","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-dnc2-binary-extension]]","embed":false},{"target